\p{The cubic is the voltage nullcline #{w=V(a-V)(V-1)} and the dashed
line is #{w=V/10}. The filled circles mark the stable focus and the
stable node. The open circle marks the saddle, the convention of
\citet{p. 103}{izhikevich2007dynamical}.}
